<%- include("partials/header") %>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge">
    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
    </svg>
    <span>Circlix — Closing the Loop on E-Waste</span>
  </div>

  <h1>Transform Electronic Waste Into Sustainable Value</h1>
  <p>
    Schedule doorstep pickups, track your e-waste from collection to certified recycling,
    and earn instant reward points while protecting our environment from toxic landfill hazards.
  </p>

  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn" href="/register">
      <span>Get Started as Citizen</span>
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
    </a>
    <a class="btn secondary" href="/login">
      <span>Login to Portal</span>
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4"/><polyline points="10 17 15 12 10 7"/><line x1="15" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <div class="hero-stat-value">100%</div>
      <div class="hero-stat-label">Certified Recyclers</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <div class="hero-stat-value">Zero</div>
      <div class="hero-stat-label">Landfill Target</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <div class="hero-stat-value">Real-Time</div>
      <div class="hero-stat-label">Workflow Tracking</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <div class="hero-stat-value">Instant</div>
      <div class="hero-stat-label">Reward Points Wallet</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="page-header" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
  <div class="page-header-text">
    <h2>Why Choose Circlix?</h2>
    <p>Closing the Loop on E-Waste — Empowering individuals and institutions with responsible, rewarding electronics disposal.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));">
  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15"/><path d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"/><path d="m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5"/><path d="M12 22V12"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h3>1. Easy Pickup</h3>
    <p>Citizens submit doorstep pickup requests with category, estimated weight, address, and preferred date in seconds.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon-wrapper" style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1;">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="16" height="16" x="4" y="4" rx="2"/><rect width="6" height="6" x="9" y="9" rx="1"/><path d="M15 2v2"/><path d="M15 20v2"/><path d="M2 15h2"/><path d="M2 9h2"/><path d="M20 15h2"/><path d="M20 9h2"/><path d="M9 2v2"/><path d="M9 20v2"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h3>2. Track Recycling</h3>
    <p>Follow your e-waste through transparent stages: Requested → Scheduled → Collected → Recycled by verified agents.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon-wrapper" style="background: #fef3c7; color: #b45309;">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M18.09 10.37A6 6 0 1 1 10.34 18"/><path d="m7 6 5 5"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h3>3. Earn Reward Points</h3>
    <p>Receive points credited directly to your digital wallet based on category rates per kg once items are safely recycled.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="feature-card">
    <div class="feature-icon-wrapper" style="background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d;">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"/><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h3>4. Responsible Recycling</h3>
    <p>Prevent heavy metals like lead, mercury, and cadmium from leaching into ecosystems through authorized dismantling.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">
  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
  <span>How The Workflow Operates</span>
</h2>

<div class="flow-steps">
  <div class="flow-step-card">
    <div class="flow-step-number">Step 01 • Citizen</div>
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Submit Pickup</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 0.85rem;">Select category (mobiles, batteries, etc.), provide address, weight, and preferred date.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="flow-step-card">
    <div class="flow-step-number">Step 02 • Admin</div>
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Approve & Assign</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 0.85rem;">Administrator verifies pickup and schedules a certified collection agent for doorstep pickup.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="flow-step-card">
    <div class="flow-step-number">Step 03 • Agent</div>
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Collect & Process</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 0.85rem;">Collection agent safely picks up items and delivers them to the authorized collection centre.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="flow-step-card">
    <div class="flow-step-number">Step 04 • Citizen</div>
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Redeem Rewards</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 0.85rem;">Upon recycling confirmation, reward points are credited and redeemable for eco vouchers.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>